@startuml Authentication_Flow
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Authentication Flow

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 20
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    ActorBackgroundColor #4caf50
    RectangleBackgroundColor #37474f
    RectangleBorderColor #78909c
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
}

actor "Guest User" as Guest #lightblue
actor "Authenticated User" as User #lightgreen

cloud "External Auth" {
    [Supabase Auth] as SupaAuth
    [Google OAuth] as Google
    [Facebook OAuth] as Facebook
}

rectangle "Frontend" {
    rectangle "Login Page\n[/login]" as Login {
        (Email/Password Form)
        (Google OAuth Button)
        (Facebook OAuth Button)
        (Forgot Password)
    }
    
    rectangle "OTP Verification" as OTP {
        (6-Digit Code Input)
        (Resend Timer)
    }
    
    [useAuthStore] as AuthStore
    [useProfileStore] as ProfileStore
    
    rectangle "Dashboard\n[/dashboard]" as Dashboard
}

rectangle "Backend" {
    [AuthController] as AuthCtrl
    database "profiles" as DB
}

' Authentication Flows
Guest --> Login : Visit /login

Login --> SupaAuth : Email/Password
Login --> Google : OAuth Flow
Login --> Facebook : OAuth Flow

SupaAuth --> OTP : New User (requires verification)
OTP --> SupaAuth : Verify OTP Code

SupaAuth --> AuthStore : JWT Token
Google --> SupaAuth : OAuth Callback
Facebook --> SupaAuth : OAuth Callback

AuthStore --> ProfileStore : Auto-Sync Profile
AuthStore --> Dashboard : Redirect on Success

ProfileStore --> DB : Create/Update Profile

note right of AuthStore
  **useAuthStore Actions:**
  - signUp(email, password, username)
  - signIn(email, password)
  - signInWithGoogle()
  - signInWithFacebook()
  - verifyOtp(email, otpCode)
  - resendOtp(email)
  - signOut()
  - initializeAuth()
end note

note bottom of Login
  **Session Storage:**
  - pendingUsername
  - pendingUserId
  (for OTP flow)
end note

@enduml
